  - Key: Every place on that board makes money for a family.
    English: 
    Turkish: "O panodaki her mek\xE2n bir aileye para kazand\u0131r\u0131yor."
  - Key: Clear their armed men, but leave the civilians alone.
    English: 
    Turkish: "Silahl\u0131 adamlar\u0131n\u0131 temizle ama sivillere dokunma."
  - Key: Find the boss and make an offer they cannot refuse.
    English: 
    Turkish: "Patronu bul ve reddedemeyece\u011Fi bir teklif yap."
  - Key: Once the boss agrees to work for us, the place is ours.
    English: 
    Turkish: "Patron bizim i\xE7in \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmay\u0131 kabul edince mek\xE2n
      bizim olur."
